# Workflow net: an intake token chooses either standard or expedited review before a merge and completion.
petri "Review Workflow Choice and Merge"
  layout: lr
  place Start *1
  place Standard
  place Expedite
  place Reviewed
  place Complete
  transition ChooseStandard
  transition ChooseExpedite
  transition ReviewStandard
  transition ReviewExpedite
  transition Close
  Start -> ChooseStandard
  ChooseStandard -> Standard
  Start -> ChooseExpedite
  ChooseExpedite -> Expedite
  Standard -> ReviewStandard
  ReviewStandard -> Reviewed
  Expedite -> ReviewExpedite
  ReviewExpedite -> Reviewed
  Reviewed -> Close
  Close -> Complete
  fire: ChooseStandard, ReviewStandard, Close
